Balance Factor = Height of Left Subtree − Height of Right Subtree
Check whether the tree is unbalanced.
If unbalanced, identify and perform the appropriate rotation:
LL case: Perform right rotation.
RR case: Perform left rotation.
LR case: Perform left rotation followed by right rotation.
RL case: Perform right rotation followed by left rotation.
Increase the rotation counter for each individual rotation performed.
